### Requisições de exemplo — extensão "REST Client" do VS Code
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Saúde da API e do banco
GET {{base}}/health

### Listar restaurantes (público)
GET {{base}}/restaurants?category=pizza&page=1&limit=10

### Cadastro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas",
  "email": "lucas@easyfood.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login (copie o token da resposta)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cliente@easyfood.com",
  "password": "easyfood123"
}

### Token capturado automaticamente do login acima
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cardápio do restaurante 1
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1/menu

### Fazer pedido
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "Rua das Flores, 123 - Centro",
  "notes": "Sem cebola",
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuItemId": 4, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Meus pedidos
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar pedido 1 (cliente só cancela enquanto está PENDENTE)
PATCH {{base}}/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELADO" }

### Cadastrar restaurante sem token -> 401
POST {{base}}/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sem token", "category": "Teste" }
